      "content": "it's just that everything is so noisy. the calls, the emails, the expectations... even when i'm alone, my brain is just running these endless loops of what needs to be done next. there's no peace. it's like i'm searching for a way to just... stop. to finally have actual, absolute silence, without having to worry about waking up to all of this again. does that even make sense? that sometimes the only thing that sounds appealing is just having it all permanently end?",
